  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6606.01 Single Trip Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6606.01 Single Trip Permit.\n\n(a) The fee for a single trip permit shall be based upon the following formula:\n\n(1) The amount of $2,500.00 per application for the administrative cost of processing and managing the shipment program;\n\n(2) The amount of $2,000.00 per application for training costs; and\n\n(3) The state police detail rate at the time of shipment, per hour per law enforcement officer or emergency responder necessary to perform complete inspections and escort the shipment through the state.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6600.html"
}
